{"obsah":"<p>A series of exhibitions at children's days is almost a tradition at the start of the season. Matouš Balík and Michal Budský headed to Jiříkovice near Brno. Vlasta and Lukáš Valný went towards 'Sun, Hay, Strawberries' country (hopefully everyone gets it), where the event took place in the local gym because of the weather. From there they moved a few hundred kilometres to Kovanice north of Prague, where the spectators were already in full swing, and with reinforcement Tobík Dolák they rode a show by the local playground. </p>\n\n<p>The next day a bigger children's day took place in the nearby Prague district of Kolovraty, where together with our Kabeláč kids' squad, Martínek Gomboš and of course Tobík Dolák we completed a rainy marathon of alternating showers and sunshine. Fortunately at least part of the exhibition stayed dry and everyone survived in good health – except for Vlasta's throat, as he hosted without a microphone :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2F20240601_160635-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2F20240601_160635.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247482\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2F20240601_160633-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2F20240601_160633.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247479\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7415-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7415.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247478\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7417-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7417.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247483\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7419-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7419.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247484\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7422-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7422.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247480\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7424-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F06%2FDSC_7424.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247481\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://fire